>> title: Pound Cake
>> category: Cakes & Loaves
>> tags: butter, vanilla, dessert, oven
>> counters: Bakery, Panadería
>> aka: panqué, panque, quatre-quarts
>> servings: 10
>> time: 1 hr 30 min

Grease and flour a #9x5-in loaf pan{}.

Preheat the #oven{} to 325°F (165°C).

Beat @unsalted butter{1%cup}(225 g; softened), @granulated sugar{1 1/4%cup}(250 g) until pale and fluffy.

Beat @eggs{4%large}(200 g), @vanilla extract{1%tsp}(5 mL) into @&(~1)creamed butter{}.

Whisk @all-purpose flour{1 3/4%cup}(220 g), @baking powder{1/2%tsp}(2 g), @table salt{1/2%tsp}(3 g).

Fold @&(~1)dry mixture{}, @whole milk{1/4%cup}(60 mL) into @&(4)batter{}.

Bake @&(~1)batter{} at 325°F for ~{70%min}.
